    "body": "Refreshed: merged main at a60e6c3d after #1615 merged. Main came in through the refreshed parent: `git merge` of `issue/1635-stock-cross-drill` (#1640 at 1e92ae6c). The merge was mechanical. It had no conflicts and no hand resolutions.\n\nGate green on a60e6c3d:\n- Targeted suites: cross_drill_neighbours 5, stock_source_cross_drill 6, stock_source_holes 6, stock_source_law 6, neighbour_law 5. All pass.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: app suites 1221 s, 0 failed. This is the one quick gate for the stack (#1634, #1640, #1644).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets --no-deps -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nThe body now says \"review only after 1e92ae6c\". Ready for a delta re-check.\n",
