    "body": "Merged in the stack order 1622, 1634, 1640, 1644.\n\nBasis of the merge:\n- The NeoTech review of each PR is for the head before the refresh. The reviews of the refreshed heads are from the author's account.\n- We compared the refreshed stack with the reviewed stack on main `7c07e8683`. The only difference is `crates/app/tests/mark_floor.rs`. The file keeps the five tests of main and adds one test. It has no conflict markers.\n- No `pr-test.yml` run was made on the refreshed heads. The last green runs are for the heads before the refresh. The post-merge gate on main is the first run of the combined tree.\n\nToken cost of this step: not known (main session, no agent).\n",
